text:
no age key in HOME/.config/winch/age.key
Set WINCH_AGE_KEY to a key file, or WINCH_AGE_IDENTITY_CMD to a command that prints a key.
To make a key, run winch secret init. A member who can read the secrets must then run winch secret rekey
